                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN UND VORRICHTUNG ZUR AKTUALISIERUNG DER LISTE DER ZU MESSENDEN ZELLEN BEI DER NEUAUSWAHL EINER ZELLE IM RUHEMODUS IN EINEM DRAHTLOSEN KOMMUNIKATIONSSYSTEM DER NÄCHSTEN GENERATION</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ ET APPAREIL POUR METTRE À JOUR UNE LISTE DE CELLULES À MESURER DANS UNE RESÉLECTION DE CELLULE EN MODE VEILLE DANS UN SYSTÈME DE COMMUNICATION SANS FIL DE PROCHAINE GÉNÉRATION</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHOD AND APPARATUS FOR UPDATING LIST OF CELLS TO BE MEASURED IN RESELECTION OF CELL IN IDLE MODE IN NEXT-GENERATION WIRELESS COMMUNICATION SYSTEM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method performed by a terminal in a communication system is provided, the method comprising:receiving, from a base station, first system information associated with measurement performed in a radio resource control, RRC, idle state;receiving, from the base station, a RRC release message including duration information for the measurement and validity area information, wherein the validity area information indicates a list of one or more validity cells and a frequency corresponding to the one or more validity cells;as a response to reception of the RRC release message, entering the RRC idle state and starting a timer with a value set to the duration information;performing the measurement in the RRC idle state based on carrier list information while the timer is running, wherein the carrier list information is stored in the terminal based on at least one of the first system information or the RRC release message; andstopping the timer based on an identification that a cell reselection is performed while the timer is running and a frequency associated with a serving cell does not match the frequency indicated by the validity area information.</p>
            </abstract>
